message: "If you use this software in your research or production systems, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: software
title: "filing-qa"
abstract: >
  Research prototype for question answering over financial filings (multimodal RAG).
  Ingests PDFs (10-K, 10-Q, earnings releases) with hybrid RRF retrieval, numeric
  grounding checks and a sandboxed calculator, measured on a 119-question golden set.
  Vision-language chart extraction is implemented but not yet validated.
version: 2.0.0
